---
import { sitePath } from "../../lib/urls";
---

<section class="reference">
  <div class="container reference-inner">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow">Reference</span>
      <h2>读懂语言与机器</h2>
      <p>
        从语法开始，了解编译器、解释器、语言服务器和标准库如何组成完整系统。
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="reference-links">
      <a href={sitePath("/docs/syntax/")}>语法规范<span>↗</span></a>
      <a href={sitePath("/docs/architecture/")}>系统架构<span>↗</span></a>
      <a href={sitePath("/docs/lib/")}>标准库<span>↗</span></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
.reference h2 {
  font-size: 34px;
  margin: 8px 0 0;
}
.reference {
  background: var(--panel-bg);
  padding: 60px 0;
}
.reference-inner {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 45px;
}
.reference p {
  color: var(--muted-text);
  max-width: 500px;
  line-height: 1.7;
}
.reference-links {
  display: grid;
  gap: 9px;
}
.reference-links a {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  background: var(--panel-bg);
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  padding: 16px 20px;
  border-radius: 8px;
  text-decoration: none;
  font-weight: 700;
}
.reference-links span {
  color: var(--overlay-1);
}
@media (max-width: 700px) {
  .reference-inner {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  }
}
</style>
